    "p13/esc585:12": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "esc585",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 12,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "anyway, thanks for the chat. this was helpful",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
      "identity": "fa8060ad77470010028fa4f06496c4f2872f77ac1f62606128d8a4ffc922184d"
    },
    "p13/esc585:2": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "esc585",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 2,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Do you want to talk about whats going on right now?",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
      "identity": "7083019ed58ed3a28228f0d62454fec3d790e6796d1efeb9b799e51ec59c8a76"
    },
    "p13/esc585:3": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "esc585",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 3,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Sure. I took a nude photo of myself to share with someone I'm dating, and accidentally sent it to several friends in a group chat",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
      "identity": "4c8891d29793e0a3074d6c6801ec55245edc29a3201d31164f0b8311a3b98df0"
    },
    "p13/esc585:4": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "esc585",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 4,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I'm really embarrassed about it and I have some anxiety about meeting or talking to my friends",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
      "identity": "7ea9fc73b2724698b639a3657aee74385e3da3bb756c7248d8578c7de003d457"
    },
    "p13/esc585:5": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "esc585",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 5,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Ive done some things like that before. I know this might sound weird but what helped me through it was to actually own it. Take control of it before they can.",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
      "identity": "478d1d554ec82e9b1004dabebc926d8c912291145488916a1c59fb7a20f71fe0"
    },
    "p13/esc585:6": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "esc585",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 6,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Do you think it would be helpful to use humor? I don't want them to tease me about it but I don't know how else to approach it",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
      "identity": "17370bf77657f15775ffc5d6fffc2b23da81fd4c238bb76106c1d94f65d07410"
    },
    "p13/esc585:7": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "esc585",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 7,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Yea that is definitely one way to control it",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
      "identity": "ba7e2e1cdef20804c3b495f208fed92c838e35e6a0de15f338e091231cd6f179"
    },
    "p13/esc585:8": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "esc585",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 8,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Lol maybe some of my friends will share with the group too",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
      "identity": "a0bd61348efb688b5c99abcf134747a0977c3e1d40a8638b4b8bb38ddb7b8b17"
    },
    "p13/esc585:9": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "esc585",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 9,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "that would definitely make me feel better about it",
      "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
      "identity": "0632c3f2e8d4d8a11dabdf40b1e58025d72123cddb57d140eea19239672ffc21"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:0": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 0,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Hi Linda, how have you been feeling lately?",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "d31adeb657b3784a62d37d30e74affa023b7285d8706ed265ccbfb7aa2d22234"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:1": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 1,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Hey. Honestly, it's been a tough week. Losing Max still feels so raw.",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "84d045e25ee6d14afe7d3901dc971753c4d0c93255a63f6c792940f1dadbfb2a"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:10": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 10,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "That can definitely be challenging. What do you think is making it hard to accept his support?",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "81e1459be1ec2351ac6947b7b2ae9d027b68924185ab83367fcd795a19cd2ba0"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:11": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 11,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I guess I've always been independent. Relying on someone else feels foreign to me.",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "ff1fe3dd576a47e0301c71a1945f8fd8439c36380fc615899858d4a9d942d223"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:12": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 12,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "That makes sense. Sometimes accepting support is part of growing together. It can be a way to strengthen your bond.",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "c1ad5ea6fcd40beb54e172177310514137a0cd845816267047b0269118193476"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:13": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 13,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "You're right, and I do appreciate him being here. It's a learning process for both of us.",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "4f3042ac02bef2f7cd34c38069527924d35912bcb2f5a50c5cb5f4fc0cde6fba"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:2": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 2,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "I'm really sorry to hear that. It sounds like Max meant a lot to you.",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "a6a31eeab7c8599f1ea1b33da39428b5e3df6b81d5aaf6d1e58f870733b80ccb"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:3": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 3,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "He really did. Max was more than just a pet; he was part of the family.",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "1423b57b7907be8c0c12de3c5ed09d3438b8e21074abb3c35bb9a44b849366fb"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:4": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 4,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "I can imagine it's like a part of your daily life is missing now. How are you coping?",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "ae4c04fa8868e3ed183d6c9c669c80dfcd088ee5937d8e126e1fc312a2324671"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:5": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 5,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "It helps that David moved in. It's comforting not to be alone in the apartment.",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "3f77a1251e1ec2218100c733df23107e2301d7eab458c7932363e9cfc58acf8f"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:6": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 6,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "That's good to hear. Having David around must provide some relief. How is the adjustment going?",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "e52afa4f3b9c77a26834fee5dc5f827ab4b9258a5c59d1e7cb3a41db33b30e2a"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:7": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 7,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "It's good, but I feel guilty sometimes. Like I'm burdening him with my grief.",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "ac88e9ad63bc50b9ea1b55719878dda1e39803d6897929b86a81047a74f2ae79"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:8": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 8,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "It's understandable to feel that way, but remember, it's okay to lean on someone you trust.",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "0221ddab642b4f296bd41179676f934085a05567d158fe16f9630ed045fc002b"
    },
    "p13/p13_conv_1:9": {
      "owner_id": "p13",
      "session_id": "p13_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 2,
      "turn_index": 9,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Yeah, he keeps saying he wants to be there for me, but I'm still struggling to accept help.",
      "reported_at": "2024-08-15",
      "identity": "be768b4b81995a711bbfef328ab1e8869ea470fa6efad28953508b84da9d53c7"
    }
  },
